  "query_preview": "(Saturday through Tuesday)...\nThe beaches won't be as hot during the day as inland areas, but\nnights will still be warm and humid with low temperatures mostly\nin the lower 70s. The higher elevations in the mountains, mostly\nabove 7000 feet, will be drier with cooler nights and days not as\nhot. Otherwise, most areas through the weekend will have hot days\nand warm humid nights through the weekend with only a few degrees\nof cooling for Monday and again on Tuesday of next week. \n\nBy the end of next week, high pressure as strong or stronger as \nthe high pressure aloft for late this week could return.",
